Current (line 51-52):
```rust
assert!((arr[0] - (-42.0_f32)).abs() < f32::EPSILON);
assert!((arr[1] - (-99.9_f32)).abs() < f32::EPSILON);
```

Fix — compare against original f64 with meaningful tolerance:
```rust
assert!((arr[0] as f64 - (-42.0)).abs() < 0.001);
assert!((arr[1] as f64 - (-99.9)).abs() < 0.002);
```

This actually tests that f64→f32 conversion preserves values within f32 precision.

