## Problem

src/commands/line_cmd.rs has test_single_point_no_commit (1 point + Confirm → Error) but no test for Confirm with 0 points (empty buffer → Error).

The behavior is correct — falls through to catch-all _ arm returning Error — but the test gap exists.

## Fix

Add test:

```rust
#[test]
fn test_confirm_empty_buffer_returns_error() {
    let mut cmd = LineCommand::new();
    let mut world = create_world();
    let result = cmd.on_input(CommandInput::Confirm, &mut world);
    assert!(matches!(result, CommandResult::Error(_)));
}
```

## Exit Criteria

- New test passes
- All existing tests still pass

